<item><title>Senegal&apos;s MPs reject 2027 budget, stopping review of remaining sections</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-s-mps-reject-2027-budget-stopping-review-of-3de59c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-s-mps-reject-2027-budget-stopping-review-of-3de59c/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>The National Assembly voted 126 to 18 against the first section, covering revenue and debt, leaving the rest of the budget unexamined.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 05:07:09 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-s-mps-reject-2027-budget-stopping-review-of-3de59c/share.jpg" length="41621" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-s-mps-reject-2027-budget-stopping-review-of-3de59c/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
